  "title": "Cajun Chicken, Shrimp, and Sausage Pasta",
  "description": "This flavorful Cajun-inspired pasta dish is chock full of chicken, shrimp, sausage, tomatoes, and veggies seasoned with Cajun spices.",
  "authors": [
